{"overview":"ریووتسو کانکیچی، یا ریو-سان برای کوتاه، پلیس غیرمتعارفی است که در ایستگاه پلیس محلی کار می‌کند و پول را دوست دارد. با ستارگان مشهور مانند ناکاگوا و ریکو، رئیس سختگیر پلیس، اوهارا، و سایر شخصیت‌های منحصر به فرد، همه را در میان ماجراهای مختلف گرفتار می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ryotsu Kankichi, or Ryo-san for short, is an unconventional cop working at the local police station who loves money. Together with famous celebrities like Nakagawa and Reiko, his strict boss Police Chief Ohara, and other wildly unique characters, he gets everyone caught up in all sorts of hijinks!","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":27,"y":1997,"poster":"/yAUhTD1la1MPv448l3pxmEZPZoW.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":344,"y":1996,"poster":"/kHwPpy7uqWEiSz2zhoGKndYBtgI.jpg"}],"episodes":344,"crew":["Noboru Misawa","鴫野彰","やすみ哲夫","高本宣弘"],"crew_en":["Noboru Misawa","Akira Shigino","Tetsuo Yasumi","Nobuhiro Takamoto"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"ラサール石井","role":"Ryotsu Kankichi (voice)","photo":"/54hhv2lBjx3Gxqmvhu6GrusVTpd.jpg","en":"LaSalle Ishii"},{"name":"佐山陽規","role":"Daijirou Ohara (voice)","photo":"/plRWLX27mtA1Rj9VFvEwAHuP2fP.jpg","en":"Haruki Sayama"},{"name":"Yuko Doi","role":"Matoi Giboshi (voice)","photo":"/fydb3hVQqtDsGY6X18Ksd6iAYRa.jpg"},{"name":"牛山茂","role":"Nerou Higurashi (voice)","photo":"/8IxquotD981LXXwi3zwomNHhjf1.jpg","en":"Shigeru Ushiyama"},{"name":"森尾由美","role":"Reiko Katherine Akimoto","photo":"/rSpkKPoVxKDN8vCWwgxqGGjOFZy.jpg","en":"Yumi Morio"},{"name":"岡本麻弥","role":"Komachi Ono (voice)","photo":"/g1k6T4wfIc6hjSMPCUq3sEU46Eh.jpg","en":"Maya Okamoto"},{"name":"西村仁","role":"Gomesu Tonda (voice)","photo":"/2X9AJYsZfxJcvbWzxi801EDpbQ9.jpg","en":"Jin Nishimura"},{"name":"宮本充","role":"Keiichi Nakagawa (voice)","photo":"/zcgbjwPHY9YV4UMpm6bvFXorWCJ.jpg","en":"Mitsuru Miyamoto"},{"name":"家中宏","role":"Hayato Honda (voice)","photo":"/eoqG5eX6TmTzaQLgl2MUkek6Jl.jpg","en":"Hiroshi Yanaka"},{"name":"麻生かほ里","